# Drive uploads (cloud) — HARD

Incident 2026-09-17: corrupt Drive stubs of 8 / 1526 / 7500 bytes; 4 child agents; 972+148 msg ERROR loops.

**After every `create_file` that uploads a sheet/workbook, run:**

```bash
python .cursor/tools/drive_create_verify.py --got-filesize <F> --expected-min-bytes <N> --title "<title>"
```

Nonzero exit ⇒ trash, retry as Google Sheet `textContent`. Do not re-inline the same `base64Content`.

| ✅ | ⛔ |
|----|----|
| `textContent` → Sheet/Doc | Multi-KB xlsx `base64Content` when a Sheet works |
| Verify `fileSize` | Child agent whose only job is base64 upload |
| `search_files` with `title contains` / `parentId =` | Free-text `query: "Monarch"` |

Full card: repo `AGENTS.md` §2.
